  "label": "User projected onto the textual material implying ownership of Autism Awareness Month",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'when she finally has your own month', which uses the deictic 'your' to imply ownership of the month. This projection is onto the text_chunk entity, which contains the phrase 'your own month', thereby anchoring the user's perspective to the concept of 'your' month being taken. The user is thus projected onto the text_chunk, which frames the scenario as if the user is the one whose month is being 'taken' by 'her'.",
